{"id":"74f4744df7db749f","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","title":"Short Weierstrass Elliptic Curve","display":"df-elliptic-curve — Short Weierstrass Elliptic Curve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elliptic-curve","aliases":["58-df-elliptic-curve","Elliptic Curve"],"display":"df-elliptic-curve — Short Weierstrass Elliptic Curve","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elliptic-curve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elliptic-curve</span><span>Elliptic Curve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elliptic-curve — Short Weierstrass Elliptic Curve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,k,O,K_E\\in V\">\\(E,k,O,K_E\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E=\\langle+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\rangle\">\\(K_E=\\langle+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\rangle\\)</span> is an explicit short-Weierstrass presentation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline 0_k=0_k\">\\(\\underline 0_k=0_k\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline{m+1}_k=+_k(\\langle\\underline m_k,1_k\\rangle)\">\\(\\underline{m+1}_k=+_k(\\langle\\underline m_k,1_k\\rangle)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Powers are the finite products for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_k\">\\(\\cdot_k\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> is the explicit field predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, with a unary compatibility form.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elliptic\\text{-}curve\\text{-}weierstrass}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_E=\\langle+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land A,B\\in k\n\\land\\underline2_k\\neq0_k\n\\land\\underline3_k\\neq0_k\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n+_k\\Bigl(\n\\bigl\\langle\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\underline4_k,A^3\\rangle),\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\underline{27}_k,B^2\\rangle)\n\\bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\neq0_k\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land O\\in V\\setminus(k\\times k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land E=\\{O\\}\\cup\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in k\\times k:\n\\cdot_k(\\langle y,y\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}{}=\n+_k\\bigl(\\langle\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle x,x\\rangle),x\\rangle),\n+_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle A,x\\rangle),B\\rangle)\n\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elliptic\\text{-}curve\\text{-}weierstrass}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_E=\\langle+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land A,B\\in k\n\\land\\underline2_k\\neq0_k\n\\land\\underline3_k\\neq0_k\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n+_k\\Bigl(\n\\bigl\\langle\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\underline4_k,A^3\\rangle),\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\underline{27}_k,B^2\\rangle)\n\\bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\neq0_k\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land O\\in V\\setminus(k\\times k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land E=\\{O\\}\\cup\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in k\\times k:\n\\cdot_k(\\langle y,y\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}{}=\n+_k\\bigl(\\langle\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle x,x\\rangle),x\\rangle),\n+_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle A,x\\rangle),B\\rangle)\n\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elliptic\\text{-}curve\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k,O,K_E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elliptic\\text{-}curve\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k,O,K_E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The nonzero discriminant clause is equivalent to nonsingularity of the short Weierstrass model; adjoining the tagged point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> gives its smooth projective completion.</li>\n<li>This concrete presentation is valid in characteristics different from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span>, which includes the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>- and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>-based downstream uses in this book.</li>\n<li>The former abstract clause depended on an undefined regular-local-ring predicate and treated a canonical sheaf as though it certified scheme-theoretic smoothness.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silverman, The Arithmetic of Elliptic Curves</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ is the explicit field predicate from [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,k,O,K_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"K_E=\\langle+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline 0_k=0_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\underline{m+1}_k=+_k(\\langle\\underline m_k,1_k\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elliptic\\text{-}curve\\text{-}weierstrass}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_E=\\langle+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land A,B\\in k\n\\land\\underline2_k\\neq0_k\n\\land\\underline3_k\\neq0_k\\\\\n&{}\\land\n+_k\\Bigl(\n\\bigl\\langle\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\underline4_k,A^3\\rangle),\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\underline{27}_k,B^2\\rangle)\n\\bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\neq0_k\\\\\n&{}\\land O\\in V\\setminus(k\\times k)\\\\\n&{}\\land E=\\{O\\}\\cup\n\\Bigl\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in k\\times k:\n\\cdot_k(\\langle y,y\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}{}=\n+_k\\bigl(\\langle\n\\cdot_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle x,x\\rangle),x\\rangle),\n+_k(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle A,x\\rangle),B\\rangle)\n\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elliptic\\text{-}curve\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k,O,K_E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E).","display":true},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false}],"bytes":2331,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6b0fdef2692e665","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"32927f4e222d9c70","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, with parameter order $(E,k,O,K_E)$ (see [[58-df-elliptic-curve]])"},{"id":"ea1eda7a3ad5e5c0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a6ab09b3579e778","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0dcb67ff541ccfe3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"883e6d2e6b682185","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (elliptic-curve predicate with field, marked point, and canonical bundle, see [[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]])"},{"id":"789230403cc61bdd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"39648aefc44f4243","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}$ 取 [[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"d0574c4044851731","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S$ (typed elliptic-curve predicate, see [[58-df-elliptic-curve]])"},{"id":"e419ede20b7ef468","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"618616f65f4acd32","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)$ (elliptic-curve predicate, see [[58-df-elliptic-curve]])"},{"id":"afd9c90ddd9c2256","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6364723ca702a8e6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E,O,K_E\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)$ is the elliptic-curve predicate from [[58-df-elliptic-curve]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md|58-df-elliptic-curve]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}